1
00:01:29,799 --> 00:01:32,878
Uh… P'Gun.

2
00:01:35,680 --> 00:01:36,448
What?

3
00:01:38,166 --> 00:01:41,800
So… what are we gonna do
about the mouse in the storage room?

4
00:01:42,499 --> 00:01:48,558
Don't overthink it. I'll handle it.
I'll go buy a trap and set it up later.

5
00:01:49,300 --> 00:01:50,500
I'll do it.

6
00:01:51,479 --> 00:01:59,439
I really don't like it… I once saw my mom do it.
The mouse got stuck on the glue trap, and its skin peeled off.

7
00:01:59,439 --> 00:02:01,159
It was horrifying.

8
00:02:01,159 --> 00:02:03,923
Are you a kid or what?

9
00:02:04,698 --> 00:02:06,512
Well… I am younger than you.
